      "sourceText": "首次收到位姿时，节点按该消息时间戳查询 `base_footprint ← front_mid360`，最大等待0.5秒；失败则告警并放弃本次位姿，后续位姿回调重试。首次成功后，把当时的雷达安装与关节变换存为固定矩阵 `C`，后续位姿和点云都使用它。",
      "translatedText": "When the pose is received for the first time, the node queries by the timestamp of that message `base_footprint ← front_mid360`, with a maximum wait of 0\\.5 seconds; if it fails, an alarm is raised and this pose is discarded, and subsequent pose callbacks will retry\\. After the first success, the radar mounting and joint transforms at that time are stored as a fixed matrix `C`, and both subsequent poses and point clouds use it\\.",
